    <div class="gp-sec" aria-label="The supplement drawer problem"><div class="gp-wrap"><h2>The Supplement Drawer Problem</h2><p>So I tried the stack. Root extract capsules, a tub of ashwagandha, maca powder, shilajit resin. Two problems killed it inside a month.</p><p><b>Adherence.</b> Four products, three different timings. I was hitting maybe half my doses by week three, and lying to myself about it.</p><p><b>Absorption.</b> Capsules pass through fast and a large share of the dose is wasted &mdash; which is why <span class="gp-pen">underdosed pills are the supplement industry's dirty secret</span>. You're paying for milligrams your body never sees.</p><p>Then I found the delivery vehicle that fixed both problems at once. It was hiding in the one habit I haven't missed a single day of in 25 years.</p><hr class="gp-rule"></div>
